# The Toffoli gate and the UNIVERSALITY of reversible computation, modeled and proved by the kernel. Ordinary boolean
# gates like AND and NAND throw information away: from a single output bit you cannot recover the two inputs, so they are
# not reversible. The Toffoli gate (the controlled-controlled-NOT) repairs this. It takes three bits (a, b, c) and returns
# (a, b, c xor (a and b)): the two controls pass through untouched and the target is flipped exactly when both controls are
# on. Because the controls survive, the map is a bijection on the eight states, so it runs backward, and in fact it is its
# OWN inverse. The remarkable fact this file proves is that this one reversible gate is UNIVERSAL for classical computation.
# Feeding it constants on the spare wires recovers each ordinary gate: a blank target computes AND, two on controls compute
# NOT, an on control copies (FANS OUT) a bit onto a blank target, and an on target computes NAND. Since AND and NOT alone
# generate every boolean function, the Toffoli gate alone computes everything any circuit can, with no information ever
# lost. The kernel discharges every claim by exhaustive induction over the bits (`fold`), the discrete heart of why a
# reversible (and hence a quantum) computer is exactly as powerful as an irreversible one.

# A bit, the unit of classical information: off or on.
form bit
  case off
  case on

# Negation: turn a bit to its opposite. The NOT gate, reversible on its own.
task not-bit
  take a, like bit
  like bit
  fork case, read a
    case off
      send back
        make on
    case on
      send back
        make off

# Conjunction: on exactly when both bits are on. The AND gate, NOT reversible on its own (three inputs map to off).
task and-bit
  take a, like bit
  take b, like bit
  like bit
  fork case, read a
    case off
      send back
        make off
    case on
      send back
        read b

# Exclusive or: on exactly when the two bits differ. Its defining property is being its own inverse, which is what makes
# the Toffoli target reversible: flipping the target by the same control twice cancels.
task xor-bit
  take a, like bit
  take b, like bit
  like bit
  fork case, read a
    case off
      send back
        read b
    case on
      send back
        call not-bit
          read b

# Not-and: on unless both bits are on. NAND is universal on its own for irreversible circuits, and the Toffoli gate
# computes it directly with an on target, the bridge to that classical universality.
task nand-bit
  take a, like bit
  take b, like bit
  like bit
  send back
    call not-bit
      call and-bit
        read a
        read b

# A triple: the three wires the Toffoli gate acts on, two controls and a target.
form triple
  case wires
    link first, like bit
    link second, like bit
    link target, like bit

# Read the target wire out of a triple, the output line every universality result inspects.
task target-of
  take t, like triple
  like bit
  fork case, read t
    case wires
      link first
      link second
      link target
      send back
        read target

# Read the first control wire out of a triple, used to show the controls pass through undisturbed.
task first-of
  take t, like triple
  like bit
  fork case, read t
    case wires
      link first
      link second
      link target
      send back
        read first

# The Toffoli gate, the controlled-controlled-NOT: keep both controls, flip the target when BOTH controls are on. The
# target becomes target xor (first and second). This is the whole gate, and everything below is a corollary of this line.
task toffoli
  take t, like triple
  like triple
  fork case, read t
    case wires
      link first
      link second
      link target
      send back
        make wires
          bind first
            read first
          bind second
            read second
          bind target
            call xor-bit
              read target
              call and-bit
                read first
                read second

# TEMPLATE: run the Toffoli gate on a triple built from two control bits and a fixed target constant, then read the target
# wire out. Every universality corollary feeds the gate two marked controls and one constant target, so this single
# template captures the shared shape and the corollaries differ only in which target constant they supply.
tree probe-target
  take const

  hook fuse
    call target-of
      call toffoli
        make wires
          bind first
            read a
          bind second
            read b
          bind target
            make {const}

# THE TOFFOLI GATE IS ITS OWN INVERSE: toffoli (toffoli t) = t, for every one of the eight triples. The two controls pass
# through, and the target is flipped by the same control product twice, which cancels. So the gate is reversible and a
# computer built from it can always be run backward, losing no information. Proved by induction over all three bits.
rule toffoli-is-its-own-inverse
  seat a, like bit
  seat b, like bit
  seat c, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call toffoli
        call toffoli
          make wires
            bind first
              read a
            bind second
              read b
            bind target
              read c
      make wires
        bind first
          read a
        bind second
          read b
        bind target
          read c
  fold a, b, c

# TOFFOLI COMPUTES AND: with the target set to off, the target output is exactly a and b. The blank wire collects the
# conjunction of the two controls, so the universal reversible gate contains the AND gate. Proved over all four control
# settings.
rule toffoli-computes-and
  seat a, like bit
  seat b, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      fuse probe-target, off
      call and-bit
        read a
        read b
  fold a, b

# TOFFOLI COMPUTES NAND: with the target set to on, the target output is the not-and of the two controls. NAND alone is
# universal for ordinary circuits, so this single setting already witnesses classical universality. Proved over all four
# control settings.
rule toffoli-computes-nand
  seat a, like bit
  seat b, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      fuse probe-target, on
      call nand-bit
        read a
        read b
  fold a, b

# TOFFOLI COMPUTES NOT: with both controls on, the target is flipped, so the target output is not c. Driving the controls
# high turns the gate into the NOT gate acting on the target. Proved over both target values.
rule toffoli-computes-not
  seat c, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call target-of
        call toffoli
          make wires
            bind first
              make on
            bind second
              make on
            bind target
              read c
      call not-bit
        read c
  fold c

# TOFFOLI FANS OUT (COPIES) A BIT: with the second control on and the target off, the target output equals the first
# control. A blank wire receives a copy of the control, the FANOUT a reversible circuit needs to reuse a value. Proved over
# both values of the copied bit.
rule toffoli-fans-out
  seat a, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call target-of
        call toffoli
          make wires
            bind first
              read a
            bind second
              make on
            bind target
              make off
      read a
  fold a

# THE CONTROLS ARE NEVER DISTURBED: the first output wire of the gate is always the first input, whatever the other bits
# are. This is the structural reason the gate is reversible (the inputs are recoverable from the outputs) and the reason
# the control lines can carry data straight through a circuit. Proved over all eight inputs.
rule toffoli-preserves-the-first-control
  seat a, like bit
  seat b, like bit
  seat c, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call first-of
        call toffoli
          make wires
            bind first
              read a
            bind second
              read b
            bind target
              read c
      read a
  fold a, b, c

# UNIVERSALITY, ASSEMBLED: the gate computes both NOT (controls high) and AND (target blank), and AND with NOT generate
# every boolean function, so the Toffoli gate alone computes every boolean function, reversibly. As a concrete witness that
# the two pieces compose, building NAND by hand from the gate's AND output and the gate's NOT equals the direct NAND, for
# all four control settings. This closes the loop from the single reversible gate to all of classical computation.
rule and-then-not-is-nand
  seat a, like bit
  seat b, like bit
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call target-of
        call toffoli
          make wires
            bind first
              make on
            bind second
              make on
            bind target
              fuse probe-target, off
      call nand-bit
        read a
        read b
  fold a, b
